# Data

This project does not require an external dataset. Its runtime data is generated by the processes.

## Data captured
- Worker process ID (PID)
- Incrementing work-cycle counter
- Controller commands: pause, resume, terminate
- Worker start and safe-exit messages
- Signal and process status observations

## Example record
| Event | Example |
|---|---|
| Worker start | `Worker started. PID=1234` |
| Work cycle | `PID 1234: working... 1` |
| Pause | Controller sends `SIGSTOP` |
| Resume | Controller sends `SIGCONT` |
| Termination | Controller sends `SIGTERM` |
| Exit | `Worker exiting safely.` |

PIDs and counter values vary on each run. The table is illustrative, not measured output.

